      "role": "user",
      "content": "'hidden risks' or 'competitive threats' feels a bit vague though. If I go into a meeting with their CTO and they ask for specific vulnerabilities or data points from the audit that justify the upgrade, what exactly am I supposed to tell them? I don't want to get caught in a lie if they start digging into the actual report.",
